WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.722
Your business is good. Your website should be too.

00:00:03.772 --> 00:00:10.719
Cung Solutions from Brugg builds websites for small businesses: clear, fast and flawless on a phone.

00:00:10.769 --> 00:00:14.770
Just like for SwissTech, Boxschule Gebenstorf and Mobile Master.

00:00:14.821 --> 00:00:22.471
The Basic website is a one-time 1,500 francs. Everything's included: contact, map, opening hours, SEO and hosting.

00:00:22.521 --> 00:00:30.665
With Pro, for 2,000 francs, you get a custom-built hero section and email on your own domain.

00:00:30.715 --> 00:00:35.084
Want more? Online booking, automatic confirmations, appointment reminders and review requests.

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:40.216
Plus flyers and business cards in the same design.

00:00:40.266 --> 00:00:48.142
In the configurator you put it all together and see your price instantly. With Pro, your two most expensive extras are free.

00:00:48.192 --> 00:00:51.330
Build your website now. Right here on this page.
